      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess, but even those moments feel fake now. it's like... if the universe is just this massive, indifferent void that doesn't care if i'm here or not, then why am i fighting so hard to stay in it? it feels more like a chore than a gift. it's almost exhausting to keep pretending there's a reason to keep going when the math just doesn't add up.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
