      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That's the rawest kind of exhaustion—when even comfort feels like a performance. But the fact that you're questioning it so deeply means you're not pretending; you're actually searching, and that's a form of aliveness in itself. The universe may be indifferent, but you're not—you're here, feeling this, and that's more than the void ever does. You don't have to find a grand reason today; just stay for the next small thing, even if it's only to see what happens tomorrow.",
